ory enables the detection of coupling strength, directionality, synergy/redundancy and higher-order interactions among physiological systems and sub-systems, revealing how network cross-communication and regulation occur within the organism. Applications of information-theoretic approaches span from analyzing information transfer between brain and body networks during various states;<ref>{{Cite journal |last1=Candia-Rivera |first1=Diego |last2=de Vico Fallani |first2=Fabrizio |last3=Boehme |first3=Rebecca |last4=Salamone |first4=Paula C. |date=2025-01-14 |title=Linking heartbeats with the cortical network dynamics involved in self-social touch distinction |journal=Communications Biology |language=en |volume=8 |issue=1 |pages=52 |doi=10.1038/s42003-024-07448-z |issn=2399-3642 |pmc=11733256 |pmid=39809818}}</ref><ref>{{Cite journal |last1=Faes |first1=L |last2=Marinazzo |first2=D |last3=Jurysta |first3=F |last4=Nollo |first4=G |date=2015-04-01 |title=Linear and non-linear brain–heart and brain–brain interactions during sleep |url=https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/0967-3334/36/4/683 |journal=Physiological Measurement |volume=36 |issue=4 |pages=683–698 |doi=10.1088/0967-3334/36/4/683 |pmid=25799205 |bibcode=2015PhyM...36..683F |issn=0967-3334|url-access=subscription }}</ref><ref>{{Cite journal |last1=Antonacci |first1=Yuri |last2=Astolfi |first2=Laura |last3=Nollo |first3=Giandomenico |last4=Faes |first4=Luca |date=2020-07-01 |title=Information Transfer in Linear Multivariate Processes Assessed through Penalized Regression Techniques: Validation and Application to Physiological Networks |journal=Entropy |language=en |volume=22 |issue=7 |pages=732 |doi=10.3390/e22070732 |doi-access=free |issn=1099-4300 |pmc=7517272 |pmid=33286504 |bibcode=2020Entrp..22..732A }}</ref> cardio-respiratory interactions;<ref>{{Cite journal |last1=Valenza |first1=Gaetano |last2=Faes |first2=Luca |last3=Citi |first3=Luca |last4=Orini |first4=Michele |last5=Barbieri |first5=Riccardo |da